fail "apis own associated type literal", "`scaled[Bytes]` cannot use `I.Item = U8`: the generic body applies `*` to a `I.Item` and the literal `300`, which `U8` cannot hold", "`lib.scaled[Bytes]` cannot use `I.Item = U8`: the generic body applies `*` to a `I.Item` and the literal `300`, which `U8` cannot hold"
  # A fact no API names, here a literal's fit, is checked at each
  # instance for an associated type as for its base, in another module's
  # generic too.

  use lib

  obj Bytes
    n: U8

